    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Charges of multiple counts of rape, oral rape, indecent assault and sexual assault followed, and his trial began in October 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384253667:14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "On 5 November 2026, Brand was convicted of one count of rape and three counts of sexual assault and remanded in custody.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384253667:334"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Russell Edward Brand, born 4 June 1975, is an English comedian and actor.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384253667:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Brand was born on 4 June 1975 in Grays.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q296609:P569",
        "wd:Q296609:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "He was educated at the Italia Conti Academy of Theatre Arts, Drama Centre London, The Hathaway Academy and the Royal Academy of Dramatic Art.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q296609:P69:Q348134",
        "wd:Q296609:P69:Q1255631",
        "wd:Q296609:P69:Q5598377",
        "wd:Q296609:P69:Q523926"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:46Z",
      "text": "1 award on record, including the James Joyce Awards.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q296609:P166:Q3806623"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:01:05Z",
      "text": "On 5 November 2026, 571,124 people read the English article, about 162× the usual.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Russell_Brand:2026-11-05",
        "views:en:Russell_Brand:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:01:12Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 11 languages, and after English, German had the most readers at 24,476.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Russell_Brand:2026-11-05",
        "views:de:Russell_Brand:2026-11-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:01:19Z",
      "text": "On the globe, each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers; a language is not a country.",
      "cites": [
        "views:de:Russell_Brand:2026-11-05",
        "views:es:Russell_Brand:2026-11-05",
